  "name": "Biggest Little Fur Con",
  "shortName": "BLFC",
  "description": "Biggest Little Fur Con (BLFC) is an annual furry convention in Reno, Nevada, the \"Biggest Little City in the World\". It is the spiritual successor to the furmeet PawFur and is organized by Reno Area Anthropomorphic Arts and Recreation (RAAAR), a 501(c)(3) non-profit. The first BLFC was held May 3 to 5, 2013, at the Grand Sierra Resort with 704 attendees, and attendance has grown to the thousands. A virtual edition, VBLFC, was held in NeosVR in 2021. Since 2023 the convention has been held in October. Each year's theme comes with extended lore, and the convention has supported the Safe Haven Wildlife Sanctuary every year since 2014.",
